   Requires streetRep>=30 (visibility), costs 1500 zł, 1×/day limit.
   Effect: +60 energy, +50 mood, +5 streetRep, -20 health, +1 _drugUses (anti-addiction tracker).
   10% bust chance: -5000 zł fine, -8 fame, -10 streetRep, drop health to 25 (hospital trip implicit). */
window.casinoBuyCoke=()=>{
  if((G.streetRep||0)<30){
    document.getElementById('bar-result').innerHTML='<span style="color:#e74c3c">⚠️ Dealer nie zna Cię — buduj reputację uliczną.</span>';return;
